DESCRIPTION:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart!\nHello everyone\,\n
 \nI'm looking forward to sharing an evening of original music\, good conve
 rsation\, and great company with all of you. Whether you're a fan of count
 ry\, folk\, rock\, singer-songwriter music\, or simply enjoy discovering s
 omething new music\; I hope you'll find songs that make you smile\, think\
 , reminisce\, and maybe even get up and dance.\n\nMost of all\, I hope thi
 s is an opportunity to relax\, meet some friendly people\, and enjoy an ex
 perience that's both entertaining\, uplifting and memorable.\n\n\\*Joined 
 by my other groups too\; so we can anticipate a wonderful evening!\n\n**Lo
 cation:** Smoke Show - 744 Mt. Pleasant Rd.\nhttps://www.smokeshowbbqandbr
 ew.com/\n**Date:** Sunday July 26th\, 2026\n**Time:** Arrive between 6:30 
 pm and 7:00 pm (if you can)\n\\*Arrive a bit early too\; if you like to ge
 t settled in :)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n
 (Songwriter and Producer)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming's Stories an
 d Love Songs (Dinner\, Dance and Listening Party)**\n\nCome and enjoy an e
 vening of original music in a relaxed\, friendly atmosphere. Whether you l
 ove country\, folk\, rock\, singer-songwriter music\, or simply discoverin
 g new artists\, this is a chance to hear songs you won't find anywhere els
 e\; while meeting people who appreciate great music.\n\n**What you can exp
 ect:**\n\n* Listen to a variety of original songs\, from heartfelt ballads
  and story songs to upbeat music you'll want to sing and dance along to\n*
  Meet fellow music lovers in a welcoming\, social environment\n* Share tho
 ughts\, ask questions\, and learn about the stories and inspiration behind
  the songs\n* Enjoy an entertaining evening filled with music\, conversati
 on\, and new friendships\n\n**About Steve Flemming**\nSteve Flemming is a 
 Canadian songwriter with a catalog of more than 1\,500 songs\, over 850 of
  which have been recorded. His music blends country\, folk\, roots\, rock\
 , and singer-songwriter traditions\, ranging from thought-provoking story 
 songs and heartfelt ballads to energetic\, feel-good songs that get people
  dancing and singing along. Inspired by everyday life\, relationships\, sp
 irituality\, and the human experience\, Steve writes music that is both en
 tertaining and meaningful\, creating songs that connect with listeners lon
 g after the music ends.\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you
  arrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gm
 ail.com](http://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n\n\\*If attending the 4:00 pm
  Family Feud event that day there will be no additional entrance fee for t
 he Listening Party event\n\n(One Beverage or Appetizer minimum please to s
 upport the venue and staff) (Plan to come for dinner too if you can)
